# Keeps the Docker build context (and every COPY <dir> in
# apps/binx-api/Dockerfile / apps/binx-web/Dockerfile) from dragging in local
# dev state. Without this, `COPY apps/binx-web ./apps/binx-web` would copy
# the host's own node_modules over the one `pnpm install` just built cleanly
# inside the image, corrupting it.
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/dist
**/build
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/uploads
.git
.github
.vscode
*.md
!apps/binx-api/README.md
